      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## KDX Wildcard Studio – 3. Overrides and the LLM switch\n\n**Overrides** (the text box) change only the current run and never the saved settings:\n- `portrait=off` – skip a category\n- `*=off, art=on` – only one category\n- `portrait.selfie=off` – skip one template\n- `select=portrait.selfie` – one fixed template, new wildcard seed every run\n- `seed=123`, `mode=pin`, `llm=on`\n\nThe string can also come from a Set/Get pair or any other STRING source.\n\n**LLM switch:** the console's `llm_enabled` output goes into the Chat's `llm_enabled` input. LLM off (the LLM pill in the panel, or `llm=off`) → Chat makes no LLM call and passes the console prompt on unchanged. LLM on → Chat rewrites the prompt with the category's `system_prompt` profile. Either way, take the Chat's `response` to CLIP Text Encode. Requires ComfyUI-KDX-LLM 0.9.0 or newer; set your server and model in **KDX LLM Client**."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## KDX Wildcard Studio – 3. Overrides and the LLM switch\n\n**Overrides** (the text box) change only the current run and never the saved settings:\n- `portrait=off` – skip a category\n- `*=off, art=on` – only one category\n- `portrait.selfie=off` – skip one template\n- `select=portrait.selfie` – one fixed template, new wildcard seed every run\n- `seed=123`, `mode=pin`, `llm=on`\n\nThe string can also come from a Set/Get pair or any other STRING source.\n\n**LLM switch:** the console's `llm_enabled` output goes into the Chat's `llm_enabled` input. LLM off (the LLM pill in the panel, or `llm=off`) → Chat makes no LLM call and passes the console prompt on unchanged. LLM on → Chat rewrites the prompt with the category's `system_prompt` profile. Either way, take the Chat's `response` to CLIP Text Encode. Requires ComfyUI-KDX-LLM 0.9.0 or newer; set your server and model in **KDX LLM Client**."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
